          <li>Works with any vehicle tracker, car by car</li>
          <li>Kilometres matched to your trips, platform hours and personal use</li>
          <li>Fines imported by CSV and matched to the driver on the day</li>
          <li>Inspections with photos, incidents and services due</li>
